        "quote": "(a) Financial impact statements shall be provided for all ordinances or amendments to any ordinance introduced to the City Council which would increase or decrease City revenues, make City appropriations or increase or decrease existing appropriations or the fiscal liability of the City, or impose functions or responsibilities on the City which will increase its expenditures or fiscal liability.",
