        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "01826a10-d421-5016-a5b4-e07b397f2d2b",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 993,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.15.060:block:1",
          "start": 399
        },
        "quote": "(b) The financial impact statement required by this section shall, if possible, include a reliable estimate in dollars of the anticipated change in revenue, expenditures or fiscal liability under the provisions of the ordinance or amendment. It shall also include a statement as to the immediate effect and, if determinable or reasonably foreseeable, the long range effect of the measure. If, after careful investigation, it is determined that no dollar estimate is possible, the statement shall contain information to that effect, setting forth the reasons why no dollar estimate can be given.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.15.060:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
